---
import PlainSummary from '../PlainSummary.astro';
---
<section class="sec" id="module-03" aria-labelledby="m3-h" data-depth="0.44">
  <div class="tube tube--side" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap mod__grid">
    <div class="col">
      <p class="eyebrow">MODULE 03 · PERSONNEL WELFARE</p>
      <h2 class="h2 recede-h" id="m3-h">Workplace safety begins with a comfortable chair.</h2>
      <p class="narr recede">The files are unsettling by design. The reading shouldn’t be. Deepwell is procedural on the surface and warm underneath: three themes tuned for long shifts, a page with no distractions, and nothing between you and the story. The dread stays in the archive. You get the armchair.</p>
      <ul class="feat">
        <li><strong>Three themes.</strong> Microfilm by day, Black Lodge by night, Cold Case when you want aged folder-stock sepia.</li>
        <li><strong>Distraction-free.</strong> No ads, no clutter, no chrome — the interface disappears while you read.</li>
        <li><strong>Just the story.</strong> Beautifully set, quietly yours.</li>
      </ul>
      <PlainSummary>Calm, cozy themes and a distraction-free page.</PlainSummary>
    </div>
    <div class="mod__visual">
      <figure class="reader reader--sm" aria-label="Distraction-free reading: the interface hidden, only the text" style="padding-top: 44px">
        <i class="reader__lamp" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0.62"></i>
        <i class="reader__edge" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0.62"></i>
        <div class="reader__body recede-slow" style="font-size: 17px">
          <p>At ten past one the lamp on the desk was the only light left. Past it the aisles went on, patient and unlit, and the clerk understood that the count would not be finished tonight, or by anyone.</p>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
